2,"Ekiti Sound - Ife (official music video) - YouTubeStream Ekiti Sound music | Listen to songs, albums, playlists ...Music | Ekiti SoundStream Ekiti Music music | Listen to songs, albums, playlists ...Home - [ekitimusic.com]Ekiti Traditional - playlist by Akinibitoye | Spotify",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XJkrX_hzDII,"Jun 19, 2018 · 4 Hours of Deep Focus Music for Studying - Concentration Music For Deep Thinking And Focus Cozy Winter Jazz Coffee Shop Ambience Smooth Jazz for Relaxation & Study Recorded in Lagos, Ekiti Sound's debut album Abeg No Vex fuses underground electronic music, fat hip hop drums, rolling African percussion, the vocal variety of Nigerian folklore & pop, and mixes it all in a calabashment of big room party bounce to create a unique and utterly spellbinding sonic-scape. Spearheading a new wave of electronic music originating from Nigeria by way of London, musician / producer / vocalist Leke aka CHiF has been travelling back and forth between his two cities, Lagos and London, continually seeking ways to explore and push the musical envelope. Play Ekiti Music and discover followers on SoundCloud | Stream tracks, albums, playlists on desktop and mobile. COMING SOON! VROOM! VROOM! “Vroom Vroom” is an energetic new drop built for speed, vibes, and pure adrenaline. Speed. Energy. No Brakes. VROOM! VROOM! Playing Now!! Listen to Old Hard Drives – VOL 2 Here NEW MERCH NEW ARRIVALS Fresh drops. Limited pieces. Wear the sound. Become a Member Discography Catalog MUSIC VIDEOS YOUTUBE […] Playlist · Ekiti Traditional · 14 items · 207 likes Preview of Spotify Sign up to get unlimited songs and podcasts with occasional ads. No credit card needed.",Ekit,Niger-Congo
